# MASTER TASK: Create and Integrate Three Comprehensive Legal Policies for Botlytices

Website: https://botlytices.com/

You are acting as a senior commercial contracts specialist, privacy compliance researcher, legal-policy drafter, full-stack developer and website implementation specialist.

Your task is to create three comprehensive, professional and commercially protective legal policy pages for Botlytices:

1. Terms of Service
2. Privacy Policy
3. Refund & Cancellation Policy

These documents must be specifically tailored to the actual services, business operations, technology, international customers and payment arrangements of Botlytices.

The objective is to reduce avoidable legal, financial, contractual, operational, privacy and customer-dispute risks while maintaining compliance with applicable laws.

**IMPORTANT:** No legal document can eliminate all liability or override mandatory statutory rights. Never create misleading, excessively broad or legally unenforceable exclusions. Prioritise enforceable protections, transparent contractual terms, clear customer obligations and properly documented transactions.

